@startuml
title G-03 用例图：智慧自习室预约管理系统（关联 FR、PR；参与者与 SRS 2.4 节一致）

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFF
  BorderColor #2F5DA8
  FontColor #10305E
}
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "学生\n（STU）" as STU
actor "自习室管理员\n（ADM）" as ADM
actor "系统管理员\n（SYS）" as SYS
actor "教师\n（TCH）" as TCH
actor "定时任务\n（系统调度）" as SCHED
actor "CAS\n（外部系统）" as CAS
actor "ACS\n（外部系统）" as ACS

rectangle "智慧自习室预约管理系统" {
  usecase "UC-01 统一身份认证登录" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02 查询座位可用性" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03 创建预约" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04 取消预约" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05 加入候补队列" as UC05
  usecase "UC-06 候补补位确认" as UC06
  usecase "UC-07 扫码/闸机签到" as UC07
  usecase "UC-08 暂时离开与返回" as UC08
  usecase "UC-09 签退" as UC09
  usecase "UC-10 超时自动释放" as UC10
  usecase "UC-11 资源与开放时段维护" as UC11
  usecase "UC-12 座位封禁与解封" as UC12
  usecase "UC-13 强制释放座位" as UC13
  usecase "UC-14 违规申诉处理" as UC14
  usecase "UC-15 使用率看板与报表" as UC15
  usecase "UC-16 系统参数配置" as UC16
  usecase "UC-17 查看审计日志" as UC17
}

STU --> UC01
STU --> UC02
STU --> UC03
STU --> UC04
STU --> UC05
STU --> UC07
STU --> UC08
STU --> UC09
STU --> UC14 : 提交申诉
ADM --> UC11
ADM --> UC12
ADM --> UC13
ADM --> UC14 : 审核申诉
ADM --> UC15
SYS --> UC16
SYS --> UC17
TCH --> UC15
SCHED --> UC10
UC01 --> CAS
UC07 --> ACS
UC06 --> UC05 : <<extend>> 收到补位通知后确认

note right of UC03
  包含规则校验：
  BR-01 时长与粒度、BR-02 当日上限、
  BR-03 可预约窗口、BR-07 信用分阈值、
  BR-11 时段不重叠（PR-02 仅本人可创建）
end note
note bottom of UC10
  包含三类超时处理：
  ST-02 未签到违约、ST-07 暂离超时释放、
  ST-09 到点未签退；并触发 UC-06 候补补位
end note
@enduml
